  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.8.3 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n* fix: support helm chart import-values by @emmanuel-ferdman in https://github.com/stackrox/kube-linter/pull/1112\n### Other Changes\n* chore(deps): bump docker/setup-buildx-action from 3.11.1 to 3.12.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/stackrox/kube-linter/pull/1074\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/goreleaser/goreleaser/v2 from 2.12.2 to 2.13.1 in /tool-imports by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/stackrox/kube-linter/pull/1076\n* chore(deps): bump the k8s-io group with 3 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/stackrox/kube-linter/pull/1075\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/v2 from 2.7.2 to 2.8.0 in /tool-imports by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/stackrox/kube-linter/pull/1079\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/sigstore/cosign/v2 from 2.5.0 to 2.6.2 in /tool-imports by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/stackrox/kube-linter/pull/1080\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator/pkg/apis/monitoring from 0.87.1 to 0.88.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/stackrox/kube-linter/pull/1082\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/go-viper/mapstructure/v2 from 2.4.0 to 2.5.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/stackrox/kube-linter/pull/1084\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/goccy/go-yaml from 1.19.1 to 1.19.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/stackrox/kube-linter/pull/1083\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/bmatcuk/doublestar/v4 from 4.9.1 to 4.9.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/stackrox/kube-linter/pull/1088\n* chore(deps): bump helm.sh/helm/v3 from 3.19.4 to 3.19.5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/stackrox/kube-linter/pull/1089\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/theupdateframework/go-tuf/v2 from 2.3.0 to 2.3.1 in /tool-imports by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/stackrox/kube-linter/pull/1090\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/sigs